        </form>
      </div>

      <h2>🧾 Conclusion</h2>
      <p>Texas's grid queue is huge, and most of it is speculative. But speculation still has an address. The counties at the top of this list are where land agents, developers and tax abatement requests are most likely to show up next, and where residents have the most reason to watch their local agendas now, before projects are locked in.</p>
      <p>We'll update these numbers as ERCOT publishes new monthly reports. For more analysis on Texas energy and AI, visit <a href="/">PowerGrabTX.com</a>.</p>

